{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.ColorCubicPowerSums","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorCubicPowerSums","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.color_power_sums","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.color_power_sums","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L48-L54","doc":"**Color-cubic color-root power sums are the q-free polynomials `−(zⁿ+1)`** for `n = 1,2,3`.\nThe statement lives over a generic commutative ring with `z : R` — **no quantum parameter appears**,\nwhich is exactly the q-freeness that forces the binding prolongation operator to be q-difference\nrather than a classical jet (z2bn second probe). Pure ring identities. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.psum3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.psum3","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L45-L46","doc":"Power sum `p₃ = e₁p₂ − e₂p₁ + 3e₃` (Newton). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.psum2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.psum2","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L42-L43","doc":"Power sum `p₂ = e₁p₁ − 2e₂` (Newton). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.psum1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.psum1","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L39-L40","doc":"Power sum `p₁ = Σ Xᵢ = e₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.e3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.e3","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L36-L37","doc":"Third elementary symmetric function: `e₃ = −(z³+z²+z+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.e2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.e2","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L33-L34","doc":"Second elementary symmetric function: `e₂ = z²+z+1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.e1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColorPowerSums.e1","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColorCubicPowerSums.lean#L30-L31","doc":"First elementary symmetric function of the color cubic's roots: `e₁ = −(z+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}